== Overview ==
The '''Laser UFO Toilet''' is a stronger version of the [[UFO Toilet]] that appears in Nightmare Mode.

Its special ability is that can stun towers with its laser gun, but it has a longer stun time and more range than the normal UFO Toilet. It also has an invisibility abilty where it goes invisible, which makes it immune to all forms of damage except from ramming from units.

== Appearance ==
The laser UFO toilet resembles the [[UFO Toilet]], however, it has a stronger laser, it is able to stun like the [[UFO Toilet]], but for longer and it has more range.

